  "prefLabel": "App 102.05 Apprenticeship standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 102.05 \"Apprenticeship standards\" means the written document approved by and registered with the New Hampshire state apprenticeship council, which sets forth the minimum labor standards required by 29 CFR 29 for training and the apprentice in a specified firm, corporation, trade or craft.\n\nSource. #6364-A, eff 10-29-96",
